Error [E3411]: `core.files.read()` inside `#Impure` gate, but `--allow-impure` was not passed
  --> tests/ui/impure_no_flag.jet:5:27
    |
  5 |         comptime cfg = fs.read("config.txt")
    |                           ^^^^
 Why: the `#Impure` block opts in to ambient comptime I/O, but the build flag is required so CI can audit builds that touch the host
 Fix: add `--allow-impure` to your `jet build` / `jet run` invocation

Error [E0915]: `String ? IOError` has no `Display` implementation
  --> tests/ui/impure_no_flag.jet:6:17
    |
  6 |         print("{cfg}")
    |                 ^^^
 Why: bare `{value}` interpolation calls `Display` — there is no default for user types
 Fix: add `impl String ? IOError.Display { fn display(self) => String { … } }`, or use `{value#Debug}` for debug output
